  "gurugram": [
    "Because Gurugram sits outside the immediate Delhi service area, we treat every booking there as a planned trip rather than an on-call visit, which means venue and timing details are confirmed further in advance than a local Delhi wedding would need. Hotel and resort venues around Gurugram are generally the easiest to plan around, since they tend to have a dedicated preparation room and predictable access for the team. Home functions or less conventional venues can still be accommodated, but we ask for more detail on the space itself — where the family will be getting ready, and roughly how much room is available. Wedding season timing affects Gurugram bookings just as it does Delhi itself, so peak-month dates are worth confirming early to avoid a scheduling clash with other travelling assignments. If the Gurugram celebration spans more than a single day, let us know the full schedule upfront so travel and accommodation for the artists, where relevant, can be planned as part of the same booking rather than arranged separately.",
    "For a travelling Gurugram booking, the right package depends on guest count just as it would locally, but travel adds one more variable worth planning around: how many functions the team needs to cover during the trip. A single-ceremony booking is the most straightforward — one date, one venue, one styling window. A multi-function Gurugram trip, covering a haldi or sangeet alongside the main wedding, is usually more efficient as one combined package rather than separate bookings, since the team is already travelling from Delhi and can plan artist time across the full stay. Fabric and accessory choices work the same way they would for a local booking — a coordinated palette for the groom and family, reviewed against outfit references before the team departs. Because Gurugram bookings involve travel, we recommend finalising the package a little earlier than you might for an in-town wedding, so fabric, artist numbers and the travel schedule can all be confirmed together rather than adjusted at short notice.",
  ],
